{"id": "vq25", "image": "vision_assets/scene_overlap.png", "question": "¿Las dos figuras se superponen o están separadas? Responde brevemente.", "must_contain": [["superpon", "encim", "traslap", "overlap", "juntas", "tocan"]]}
