// ── v2 HARDENING (vq70-vq85, 16) — top-end de-saturation: crowded counting,
//   color+shape counting with distractors, negation (zero of a shape), vertical
//   spatial (top/middle/bottom), distractor panels (pick the RIGHT vital), finer
//   chart reading (specific bar value, non-monotonic trend, near-equal pie slices),
//   tougher alphanumeric OCR, and receipt price-comparison reasoning. New synthetic
//   assets generated by ensure_vision_assets(). ─────────────────────────────────
{"id": "vq70", "image": "vision_assets/scene_seven.png", "question": "¿Cuántas figuras hay en total en la imagen? Responde solo el número.", "must_contain": [["7", "siete"]], "note": "crowded counting (7 mixed)"}
